{"path":"experimental/ranges/utility/exchange","title":"std::experimental::ranges::exchange","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::ranges::</span>exchange","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/utility/exchange","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Replaces the value of obj with new_value and returns the old value of obj, as if by","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/experimental/ranges/utility\">&lt;experimental/ranges/utility&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-ranges\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> MoveConstructible T, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> U <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; requires Assignable<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>, U<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> T exchange<span class=\"br0\">(</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> obj, U<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> new_val <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/* see below */</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-ranges-ts t-mark-ts\">(ranges TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Replaces the value of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">obj</span></code> with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">new_value</span></code> and returns the old value of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">obj</span></code>, as if by\n</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code>T old_value <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>obj<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\nobj <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>U<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>new_value<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">return</span> old_value<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> obj\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> object whose value to replace\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> new_value\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the value to assign to <code>obj</code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The old value of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">obj</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<div class=\"t-noexcept-full\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/language/noexcept_spec\"><code>noexcept</code></a> specification:&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<div class=\"t-noexcept-box\"><span class=\"t-cc\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_move_constructible\"><span class=\"kw549\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_nothrow_move_constructible</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">value</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span><br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_assignable\"><span class=\"kw555\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_nothrow_assignable</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>, U<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">value</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span>